u i la’u galuega, ina ia latou maua se malamalama e uiga ia te outou e ala i le Agaga Paia, ma e uiga foi i isi ituaiga latou te lē o iloa, o le a tausia nei upu o le a outou tusia ma o le a faaali atu i Nuuese, ina ia mafai, e ala i le atoatoaga o Nuuese, ona aumai i totonu, le vaega o totoe o a latou fanau, o ē o le a faataapeapeina i luga o le fogaeleele ona o lo latou lē talitonu, pe aumai i latou i se malamalama e uiga ia te a’u, lo latou Togiola.","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"Ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"ou"},{"en":"·","sm":"te"},{"en":"·","sm":"poloai"},{"en":"And I command","sm":"atu"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"te"},{"en":"you","sm":"outou"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"outou"},{"en":"·","sm":"tusia"},{"en":"·","sm":"nei"},{"en":"that ye write these words","sm":"upu"},{"en":"·","sm":"pe"},{"en":"·","sm":"a"},{"en":"·","sm":"mavae"},{"en":"·","sm":"ona"},{"en":"·","sm":"ou"},{"en":"after I am gone,","sm":"alu,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ina"},{"en":"·","sm":"afai"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"ole"},{"en":"·","sm":"atu"},{"en":"so that if they ask not","sm":"ai"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"Tamā"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"lo’u"},{"en":"of the Father in my name","sm":"igoa"},{"en":"·","sm":"o’u"},{"en":"·","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"my people at Jerusalem,","sm":"Ierusalema,"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"latou"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"they who","sm":"ē"},{"en":"·","sm":"na"},{"en":"·","sm":"vaai"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"te"},{"en":"saw me","sm":"a’u"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"faatasi"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"and were with me","sm":"a’u"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"la’u"},{"en":"in my ministry,","sm":"galuega,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ina"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"latou"},{"en":"·","sm":"maua"},{"en":"·","sm":"se"},{"en":"that they may obtain a knowledge","sm":"malamalama"},{"en":"·","sm"